          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Spirit Bond",
          "passive_description": "<ul><li><p>The Spirit Hawk is a <strong>companion</strong>: it takes no turn of its own. At the start of its owner's turn, before them, it performs one action.</p></li><li><p>Its Accuracy and damage grow with its owner's level.</p></li><li><p>Its owner's <strong>Warden of the Wilds</strong> set: 2 pieces — 【🏹 Dive Strike】 applies <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.D6IehPsp6h7srIJH\" data-id=\"D6IehPsp6h7srIJH\" data-type=\"Item\">Hunter's Mark</a>; 3 pieces — its attacks gain <strong>+3</strong> Accuracy; 4 pieces — 【🏹 Dive Strike】 gains <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.noUOPxPoZq65yYxV\" data-id=\"noUOPxPoZq65yYxV\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Combo</a> <strong>2</strong> <em>(both attacks target the same creature)</em>.</p></li></ul>",
